		<div id="failureMsgFld" style="width:500px;height:200px;position:fixed;top:30%;left:50%;margin-left:-250px;display:none;background-color:#fff;z-index:10050 !important;border:1px solid #e50112;">
			<div style="display:block;padding:5px 5px;height:40px;background-color:#e50112;color:white;">
				<span style="display:inline-block;margin-left:10px;margin-top:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;" id="effectiveTitle">提示信息</span>
				<span style="float:right;padding:10px 10px;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;" onclick="closeFailureMsg()"><i class="icon-remove"></i></span>
			</div>
			<div style="display:block;padding:10px 10px;height:120px;overflow-y:auto;">
				<div id="failureMsg" style="color:red;"></div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div id="doSCFld" style="width:80%;height:500px;position:fixed;top:10%;left:10%;display:none;background-color:#fff;z-index:10050 !important;border:1px solid #4d90fe;">
			<form id="doSCFrm" method="post">
				<input type="hidden" name="effectiveApplys" id="effectiveApplys">
				<input type="hidden" name="opeCr" id="opeCr">
				<div style="display:block;padding:5px 5px;height:40px;background-color:#4d90fe;color:white;">
					<span style="display:inline-block;margin-left:10px;margin-top:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;" id="effectiveTitle">班次列表</span>
					<span style="float:right;padding:10px 10px;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;" onclick="closeDoSCFld()"><i class="icon-remove"></i></span>
				</div>
				<div style="display:block;padding:5px 10px;height:420px;overflow-y:auto;">
					<div style="text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">
						课程名称：<span id="curCourseName" style="margin-right:10px;color:red;"></span>  
						课程编号：<span id="curCourseCode" style="color:red;"></span>
					</div>
					<div style="margin-left:3px;margin-bottom:5px;margin-top:5px;"><span id="warnMsg" style="color:red;font-weight:bold;margin-right:10px;"></span>共有<span id="accessClassCnt"></span>个班次同时开课，请点击选课序号选课。</div>
					<table id="accessClassTbl" class="table table-bordered table-full-width dataTable">
						<thead class="sorting_asc_disabled sorting_desc_disabled">
							<tr>
								<th>选课序号</th>
								<th>班级序号</th>
								<th>允许最大人数</th>
								<th>申请人数</th>
								<th>已录人数</th>
								<th>建议优选专业</th>
								<th>任课教师</th>
								<th>上课周次</th>
								<th>上课时间</th>
								<th>上课地点</th>
							</tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody></tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
			</form>
		</div>
		
		<div id="noticeFld" style="width:600px;height:250px;position:fixed;top:30%;left:50%;margin-left:-300px;display:none;background-color:#fff;z-index:10050 !important;border:1px solid #e50112;">
			<div style="display:block;padding:5px 5px;height:40px;background-color:#e50112;color:white;">
				<span style="display:inline-block;margin-left:10px;margin-top:10px;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;" id="noticeTitle">选课注意事项</span>
				<span style="float:right;padding:10px 10px;font-size:22px;cursor:pointer;" onclick="closeNotice()"><i class="icon-remove"></i></span>
			</div>
			<div style="display:block;padding:10px 10px;height:170px;overflow-y:auto;">
				<div style="color:red;">
					(1)必须先选以前学期不及格的必修课(下学期不开课课程除外)<br>
            		(2)建议优先选择下学期开设的你前几个学期未读的必修课<br>
            		(3)选课总学分不能超过50,通识教育中的大学英语1－4级，计算机类，体育类，形势与政策每学期只能选修2门;<br>
            		(4)文化素质类的选课学分不能超过4,若有超过4学分的课程只能选1门.
            		备注:由于部分学院教学计划更改,导致各年级的课程代码有时可能不一致,需要重修的学生可从选课页面右上角所有学院开设课程中选课。<br>
					(5)计算机类课程选课请仔细阅读选课手册
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div id="teachInfoFld" style="width:50%;height:520px;position:fixed;top:10%;left:25%;display:none;background-color:#fff;z-index:10050 !important;border:1px solid #e50112;">
			<div style="display:block;padding:5px 5px;height:40px;background-color:#e50112;color:white;">
